{'symbol': 'EW', 'date': '2021-12-20 09:05:00', 'title': 'EDWARDS RECEIVES FDA APPROVAL FOR SAPIEN 3 WITH ALTERRA PRESTENT FOR TRANSCATHETER PULMONIC VALVE REPLACEMENT', 'text': 'IRVINE, CALIF., DEC. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EDWARDS LIFESCIENCES (NYSE: EW) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT RECEIVED APPROVAL FROM THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) FOR THE USE OF THE EDWARDS SAPIEN 3 TRANSCATHETER VALVE WITH THE ALTERRA ADAPTIVE PRESTENT (SAPIEN 3 WITH ALTERRA) FOR PATIENTS WITH SEVERE PULMONARY REGURGITATION.'}